# A node that panics is a fault: the step gives the fault to every watch that asked for faults, then
# the run ends and each watch is told why.
load_plugin {plugin}
put_graph boom {graphs}/boom.json
watch 1 all fault
watch 2 all
start boom
feed 1 in u32:1
step 1 1
next 1
next 2
next 2
stop 1 immediate
next 1
next 2
unwatch 1
next 1
unwatch 2
